<h1>My Gaming Interests</h1>

<p>
    I enjoy video games because they combine strategy, creativity, and competition in different ways.
    Each game I play offers a different experience, from fast-paced team games to relaxing sandbox worlds.
    I think that games really help me relax and keep my mind sharp since I can choose to play very competitive or laid back.
    It also gives me something to do during my free time.
</p>

<p>
    This website highlights a few of my favorite games and what makes them interesting to me, what I would rank them, my hours spent in them and a short description.
</p>